00:34:21.010 --> 00:34:26.610
If there's a wedding in the future, we're totally choosing a band, no DJ, people will dance.
如果将来有婚礼，我们完全选择一支乐队，没有DJ，人们会跳舞。

00:34:26.610 --> 00:34:27.610
Yes, Emily.
是的，艾米丽。

00:34:27.610 --> 00:34:28.610
My favorite line.
我最喜欢的线路。

00:34:28.610 --> 00:34:29.610
Yes.
是的。

00:34:29.610 --> 00:34:38.730
Who knows if he's actually my Ted, but I know it will all be told as part of the epic details when I tell my kids the incredible story of how I met their father.
谁知道他是否真的是我的特德，但我知道当我向我的孩子们讲述我如何遇见他们父亲的令人难以置信的故事时，这一切都会作为史诗细节的一部分被讲述。

00:34:38.730 --> 00:34:44.690
There are so many wonderful experiences and memories I have because of this show and the lessons it's taught me, and they keep on coming.
由于这个节目以及它教给我的教训，我有很多美好的经历和回忆，而且它们还在继续。

00:34:44.690 --> 00:34:59.010
I really could go on all day about what a lovely story y'all have created and portrayed, but I will spare you the rest, keeping the amazing people you are, and thank you from the bottom of my heart for creating something so wonderful and meaningful, Emily from Utah.
我真的可以用一整天的时间来讲述你们创造和描绘的多么可爱的故事，但我会为你们保留剩下的时间，保留你们这些令人惊叹的人，并从心底感谢你们创造了如此美妙和有意义的东西，来自犹他州的艾米丽。

